  "scope": "Fixed7960-slot actual initialization followed by actual finite iteration. The same heap and saved original context pass through both real calls. All six initial packing-state fields and the final old BinaryFractionalCore.run.state are constructed internally; no initial state, intermediate oracle result, unary cursor, or output is supplied. Initial state widths are derived from original capacity/delta widths and composed with the additive cumulative iteration bound. One physical accounting theorem pays the same run and terminal attempt using only original graph/demand dimensions, original fraction/label width, numerical fuel and fuel-word length, initial heap/address bounds. Original represented graph/capacity/delta/fuel/context remain inputs. Constructing delta and numerical fuel, raw input preparation, outer degenerate dispatch and full paper runtime remain separate. Numerical-fuel polynomial is not claimed a fuel-bit-only polynomial",
